@startuml sequence-authoring-moderation-publish-m23
title SEQ-08: Content Authoring, Moderation & Publishing Flow (UC-08 / UC-09 / UC-10)
autonumber
skinparam style strictuml
skinparam BoxPadding 10
skinparam ParticipantPadding 10

actor "Organizational\nManager" as Manager
actor "Lesson Creator" as Creator
actor "Moderator" as Moderator
actor "Administrator" as Admin
boundary "Web Admin Portal\n(lingora-admin)" as AdminUI
control "Content Service\n(Admin BFF / Prisma)" as ContentSvc
database "PostgreSQL Database\n(Core Schema)" as DB
entity "AuditLog Store\n(Append-Only Ledger)" as Audit

== 1. Content Assignment & Authoring (UC-08 / BF-03, BF-04) ==
Manager -> AdminUI: Create Assignment Brief & Assign Lesson to Creator (SCR-A-01)
activate AdminUI
AdminUI -> ContentSvc: POST /api/admin/lessons/assign { lessonId, creatorId, brief }
activate ContentSvc
ContentSvc -> DB: UPDATE "Lesson" SET creatorId = targetId, status = 'DRAFT'\n(assignmentBrief [TARGET-CANDIDATE DD-04 / OPEN DESIGN])
activate DB
DB --> ContentSvc: Lesson updated
deactivate DB
ContentSvc --> AdminUI: 200 OK { status: "ASSIGNED" }
deactivate ContentSvc
AdminUI --> Manager: Assignment confirmed

Creator -> AdminUI: Open assigned Lesson (SCR-A-02), author 5 exercises & vocabularies
Creator -> AdminUI: Click "Submit for Review"
AdminUI -> ContentSvc: POST /api/admin/lessons/{id}/submit-review
activate ContentSvc
ContentSvc -> DB: UPDATE "Lesson" SET status = 'IN_REVIEW' WHERE id = lessonId AND creatorId = auth.uid()
activate DB
DB --> ContentSvc: Status updated to IN_REVIEW
deactivate DB
ContentSvc --> AdminUI: 200 OK { status: "IN_REVIEW" }
deactivate ContentSvc
AdminUI --> Creator: Submission confirmed

== 2. Content Moderation (UC-09 / BF-05, BF-06) ==
Moderator -> AdminUI: Open review queue, inspect lesson content & exercises (SCR-A-04)

alt Academic Quality Satisfactory -> APPROVE
    Moderator -> AdminUI: Click "Approve Lesson"
    AdminUI -> ContentSvc: POST /api/admin/lessons/{id}/approve
    activate ContentSvc

    note right of ContentSvc
        Separation of Duties (SoD) Guard (ADR-005 / SEC-D8):
        Enforce reviewer is NOT the content author:
        IF auth.uid() == Lesson.creatorId THEN
            REJECT 403 Forbidden (SOD_VIOLATION_SELF_REVIEW)
        END IF
    end note

    ContentSvc -> DB: Query Lesson.creatorId
    activate DB
    DB --> ContentSvc: Return creatorId
    deactivate DB

    alt Self-Approval Attempt (auth.uid() == Lesson.creatorId)
        ContentSvc --> AdminUI: 403 Forbidden (SOD_VIOLATION_SELF_REVIEW)
        AdminUI --> Moderator: Error: Creators cannot approve their own authored lessons.
    else Valid Distinct Reviewer
        ContentSvc -> DB: UPDATE "Lesson" SET status = 'APPROVED', reviewerId = auth.uid()\nWHERE id = lessonId AND status = 'IN_REVIEW'
        activate DB
        DB --> ContentSvc: Lesson approved
        deactivate DB
        ContentSvc --> AdminUI: 200 OK { status: "APPROVED" }
        AdminUI --> Moderator: Approval recorded
    end
    deactivate ContentSvc

else Academic Deficiencies Detected -> REQUEST CHANGES (BF-06)
    Moderator -> AdminUI: Enter review notes & click "Request Changes"
    AdminUI -> ContentSvc: POST /api/admin/lessons/{id}/request-changes { notes }
    activate ContentSvc
    ContentSvc -> DB: UPDATE "Lesson" SET status = 'CHANGES_REQUESTED'\n(reviewNotes [TARGET-CANDIDATE DD-04 / OPEN DESIGN])
    activate DB
    DB --> ContentSvc: Status updated to CHANGES_REQUESTED
    deactivate DB
    ContentSvc --> AdminUI: 200 OK { status: "CHANGES_REQUESTED" }
    deactivate ContentSvc
    AdminUI --> Creator: Notification with notes -> Creator edits draft and resubmits
end

== 3. Standard Publication (UC-10 / BF-07) ==
Manager -> AdminUI: View APPROVED lessons queue (SCR-A-06)
Manager -> AdminUI: Click "Publish Lesson"
AdminUI -> ContentSvc: POST /api/admin/lessons/{id}/publish
activate ContentSvc
ContentSvc -> DB: UPDATE "Lesson" SET status = 'PUBLISHED', isPublished = true, publishedAt = now()
activate DB
DB --> ContentSvc: Lesson published

ContentSvc -> DB: Check parent Unit: Are 4/4 child lessons PUBLISHED?
alt 4/4 Lessons PUBLISHED
    DB -> DB: UPDATE "Unit" SET isPublished = true (Visible in Learner Catalog)
else < 4 Lessons PUBLISHED
    DB -> DB: Unit remains hidden from public catalog
end
deactivate DB

ContentSvc --> AdminUI: 200 OK { status: "PUBLISHED", unitVisible: boolean }
deactivate ContentSvc
AdminUI --> Manager: Lesson published successfully

== 4. Administrator Emergency Publishing (SoD Constrained Exception) ==
Admin -> AdminUI: Request Emergency Publish for urgent release (SCR-A-06)
AdminUI -> ContentSvc: POST /api/admin/lessons/{id}/emergency-publish { justification }
activate ContentSvc

ContentSvc -> DB: Query current lesson status
activate DB
DB --> ContentSvc: Return status
deactivate DB

alt Current status == 'APPROVED' (Legitimate Emergency Bypass)
    ContentSvc -> DB: UPDATE "Lesson" SET status = 'PUBLISHED', isPublished = true
    activate DB
    DB --> ContentSvc: Published
    deactivate DB

    ContentSvc -> Audit: INSERT INTO "AuditLog" (\n  action = 'EMERGENCY_PUBLISH', actorId = auth.uid(),\n  targetId = lessonId, justification = text, timestamp = now()\n)
    activate Audit
    Audit --> ContentSvc: Audit entry recorded
    deactivate Audit
    ContentSvc --> AdminUI: 200 OK { status: "PUBLISHED", audited: true }
    AdminUI --> Admin: Emergency publication confirmed with immutable audit trace

else Current status != 'APPROVED' (Attempt to bypass review)
    ContentSvc --> AdminUI: 403 Forbidden (SOD_ADMIN_MUST_BE_APPROVED)\n[Admin cannot publish DRAFT or IN_REVIEW content]
    AdminUI --> Admin: Action rejected: Content must be reviewed and APPROVED first
end
deactivate ContentSvc

== 5. Content Revision (Clone-to-Draft v2) ==
Manager -> AdminUI: Request revision of active published lesson v1
AdminUI -> ContentSvc: POST /api/admin/lessons/{id}/clone-to-draft
activate ContentSvc
ContentSvc -> DB: INSERT INTO "Lesson" (\n  version = 2, status = 'DRAFT',\n  content = v1.content\n) (supersedesId = v1.id [TARGET-CANDIDATE DD-02 / OPEN DESIGN]; v1 remains PUBLISHED and active)
activate DB
DB --> ContentSvc: Lesson v2 draft created
deactivate DB
ContentSvc --> AdminUI: 200 OK { newDraftId: v2.id }
deactivate ContentSvc
AdminUI --> Manager: v2 Draft ready for authoring (v1 uninterrupted)
deactivate AdminUI

@enduml
